WEBVTT

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:44.043
FLEX X COP 2

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.963
CHARACTERS, PLACES, ORGANIZATIONS, AND EVENTS IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:48.966
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.387
We got a report of a body. Rosebud Hotel.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:55.972
PREVIOUSLY

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:58.015
It looks like she's been dead for a while.

00:00:58.016 --> 00:00:59.850
It's been at least 12 hours.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:03.187
She was stabbed in three places, but there's not much bleeding.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.940
Do you know the victim?

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:07.441
Her name's Oh Minyeong. She's a concierge.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:09.694
Men just wouldn't leave her alone.

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:11.404
She's gorgeous.

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:13.614
Have you seen anyone suspicious lately?

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.575
Ah! Room 701.

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:17.868
There's a suspect in the seventh-floor suite.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.370
I heard he's a chaebol heir.

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.664
He kept calling for Minyeong,

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:23.165
Saying he had requests to make.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:25.418
- Chunsik? - Isoo!

00:01:25.419 --> 00:01:26.919
You've been here three weeks.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.213
- Did you run away from home? - No, I just...

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:31.508
Is it because of Ms. Oh Minyeong?

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:35.387
The person I fell for at first sight is...

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:39.433
It's you, Minyeong.

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.435
Minyeong.

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:43.937
I'm sorry. I have a boyfriend.

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.107
Minyeong...

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:52.278
Do you know anyone who might've had a grudge against Ms. Oh Minyeong?

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:54.530
I saw everything, you bitch!

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:56.824
You've got it all wrong. It's not me!

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.868
You psycho bitch!

00:01:58.869 --> 00:02:02.330
Do you have any idea who you're dealing with? Huh?

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:04.832
- Who was she? - It was the hotel owner's wife.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:08.127
The owner was dating Ms. Oh Minyeong?

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:11.255
There were rumors that he was in love with her.

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.715
I have nothing else to say.

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.550
I said we're not done.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:15.552
Let go.

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:19.639
He tried to drag her into Room 709?

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.975
That room has been vacant for two months.

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.519
I kept that room for my own personal use.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:29.315
We took the carpet in for testing, and there wasn't enough blood.

00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:31.609
I don't think she was murdered here.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.528
She died somewhere else?

00:02:42.204 --> 00:02:43.622
What's this?

00:02:51.505 --> 00:02:53.632
Are you checking out?

00:03:03.725 --> 00:03:06.769
Detective Jin, it's Room 701. I came in to clean,

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.021
And I found something that looks like blood.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.232
What?

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.276
Kang Chunsik.

00:03:21.993 --> 00:03:23.578
:cue

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.715
Watch out!

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:39.261
Don't worry. My car's more expensive.

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:43.181
How dare he try to take me on?

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:12.710
Hey, hey.

00:04:12.711 --> 00:04:14.629
Vehicle ahead, stop the car.

00:04:15.297 --> 00:04:17.798
The trust-fund kid in car 6383!

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:19.383
Stop the car!

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:21.887
What's he doing?

00:04:24.639 --> 00:04:26.266
Stop the car!

00:04:36.651 --> 00:04:37.943
My good citizens!

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.654
Chunsik Food's sole heir is on the run!

00:04:40.655 --> 00:04:43.157
We are police.

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:45.786
Kang Chunsik is on the run!

00:04:46.495 --> 00:04:48.454
Kang Chunsik, stop the damn car!

00:04:53.251 --> 00:04:56.004
That brat just won't listen.

00:04:57.047 --> 00:04:58.255
Here we go.

00:05:42.926 --> 00:05:45.095
- What the hell are you doing? - Mr. Kang Chunsik.

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:47.888
You're under arrest for the murder of Oh Minyeong.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:49.099
What?

00:05:51.476 --> 00:05:54.270
Isoo. Why are you doing this to me?

00:05:54.271 --> 00:05:56.522
What do you mean? You just ran from the police.

00:05:56.523 --> 00:05:58.357
We're taking you into custody, punk.

00:06:04.531 --> 00:06:05.656
Isoo!

00:06:15.333 --> 00:06:16.376
EPISODE 6

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:39.566
What kind of steak knife comes with room service?

00:06:42.569 --> 00:06:43.570
Why did you run away?

00:06:44.946 --> 00:06:47.448
I was just on my way home.

00:06:47.449 --> 00:06:49.533
My car's just really fast.

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:53.121
You said Ms. Oh Minyeong left your room around 7:40 p.m.

00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:54.872
That's right.

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:56.206
What did you do after that?

00:06:56.207 --> 00:06:58.459
Oh, for god's sake.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.878
Answer the question.

00:07:02.547 --> 00:07:04.966
I was drinking because I was upset. :cue

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.109
And then?

00:07:26.404 --> 00:07:28.447
I ran out of alcohol, so I went to the bar.

00:07:37.624 --> 00:07:38.667
Evening, sir.

00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:44.047
- The usual, please. - Yes, sir.

00:07:47.008 --> 00:07:48.802
I was there until around 10:00 p.m.

00:07:58.269 --> 00:07:59.603
DETECTIVE PARK JUNYOUNG

00:07:59.604 --> 00:08:03.024
The photo below is Rosebud Restaurant's steak knife.

00:08:10.281 --> 00:08:12.199
Were you angry Ms. Oh rejected you?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.784
Of course I was.

00:08:13.785 --> 00:08:15.704
So you called her back, didn't you?

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:35.056
- You stabbed her with the steak knife. - What?

00:08:35.724 --> 00:08:36.933
Minyeong.

00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:51.239
Please don't kill me.

00:09:15.096 --> 00:09:17.348
What on earth are you talking about?

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.392
Here.

00:09:20.393 --> 00:09:23.063
- This is Room 701, where you stayed. - That's right.

00:09:25.106 --> 00:09:27.107
We found blood there.

00:09:28.443 --> 00:09:30.612
And signs that the floor had been cleaned.

00:09:36.159 --> 00:09:37.202
Where is the knife?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:41.831
Wait...

00:09:42.957 --> 00:09:44.250
You mean...

00:09:45.251 --> 00:09:46.377
Minyeong...

00:09:48.797 --> 00:09:50.673
Died in my hotel room?

00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:53.843
That's exactly what we're saying.

00:09:55.512 --> 00:09:57.138
But I...

00:10:00.058 --> 00:10:01.392
I slept there.

00:10:05.897 --> 00:10:09.234
Seriously, why is he always passing out?

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.366
-  Did you call? -  Yes.

00:10:17.367 --> 00:10:19.494
Please lock him up when he's awake.

00:10:25.917 --> 00:10:27.042
Is he okay?

00:10:27.043 --> 00:10:29.629
He's fine. He'll wake up if you give him some water.

00:10:33.007 --> 00:10:34.551
:cue

00:10:36.928 --> 00:10:38.512
Hello.

00:10:38.513 --> 00:10:39.514
I'm with the police.

00:10:40.223 --> 00:10:41.224
Right.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.226
By any chance,

00:10:44.978 --> 00:10:47.146
Do you remember this guest?

00:10:47.147 --> 00:10:48.355
Ah...

00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:49.439
I do.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:52.943
Did he come here on the night of the 13th?

00:10:52.944 --> 00:10:53.945
Yes.

00:10:54.737 --> 00:10:57.406
I was supposed to get off at 8:00 p.m.,

00:10:57.407 --> 00:10:59.909
But the night staff didn't show, so I was stuck on duty.

00:11:06.791 --> 00:11:08.668
I had plans, but I couldn't make it.

00:11:09.669 --> 00:11:12.087
What time was that?

00:11:12.088 --> 00:11:16.134
It was a little before 8:30 p.m.

00:11:17.093 --> 00:11:19.053
Around 8:20.

00:11:21.389 --> 00:11:22.598
KEY SUSPECTS KANG CHUNSIK

00:11:22.599 --> 00:11:24.558
YEOM JAESEOP, CHA SERAN, YEOM KIJOO

00:11:24.559 --> 00:11:26.811
I really don't think it's Chunsik.

00:11:32.358 --> 00:11:33.359
Hello?

00:11:34.152 --> 00:11:36.111
He came to the bar around 8:20 p.m.

00:11:36.112 --> 00:11:37.113
Got it.

00:11:37.822 --> 00:11:39.698
Pull up the bar hallway.

00:11:53.463 --> 00:11:54.839
Oh, there he is.

00:11:56.174 --> 00:11:59.426
It doesn't look like Chunsik's our guy.

00:11:59.427 --> 00:12:02.305
He may not look like it, but he's a good kid.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:09.270
He killed the victim in a fit of rage,

00:12:12.565 --> 00:12:14.817
Went up to the bar for a drink,

00:12:18.238 --> 00:12:21.574
Returned to get rid of the body,

00:12:25.995 --> 00:12:27.580
And wiped the floor.

00:12:30.583 --> 00:12:32.669
Kang Chunsik is the only one who can do that.

00:12:33.336 --> 00:12:34.921
Then how did he move the body?

00:12:35.672 --> 00:12:36.965
Did he carry her?

00:12:42.136 --> 00:12:45.055
And even if he knew about Room 709 through the rumors,

00:12:45.056 --> 00:12:47.058
How would he get in? He doesn't have a key.

00:12:47.725 --> 00:12:49.477
He could've called someone to do it.

00:13:00.113 --> 00:13:02.906
Without the camera, we can't confirm anything.

00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:04.700
Did you check all the footage?

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:07.203
No, not even half. There's too much to go through.

00:13:07.996 --> 00:13:10.497
- Let's split it. Send it over. - Yes, ma'am.

00:13:10.498 --> 00:13:12.332
Time of death was around 8:00 to 9:00 p.m.

00:13:12.333 --> 00:13:15.627
We have to find everyone who entered the hotel, took the elevator,

00:13:15.628 --> 00:13:17.921
Or got off on the seventh floor during that time.

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:18.923
Understood.

00:13:24.012 --> 00:13:26.138
SEOUL GANGHA POLICE STATION

00:13:26.139 --> 00:13:27.682
DETECTIVE DIVISION

00:13:37.608 --> 00:13:39.067
Aren't you guys hungry?

00:13:39.068 --> 00:13:40.819
Let's order some food.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.321
I'll order it. How about a sandwich?

00:13:43.322 --> 00:13:46.033
Sounds good. I'll get a beef sandwich.

00:13:46.034 --> 00:13:47.993
Beef.

00:13:50.538 --> 00:13:51.705
Detective Joo?

00:13:51.706 --> 00:13:53.290
I'll get the Italian B.M.T.

00:13:53.291 --> 00:13:54.499
Ooh.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.794
Italian B.M.T.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.800
This is yours, bro.

00:14:04.594 --> 00:14:06.929
- This is Detective Joo's. -  Thank you.

00:14:07.889 --> 00:14:11.224
Beef sandwich is the way to go.

00:14:11.225 --> 00:14:12.434
It's stuffed with meat.

00:14:12.435 --> 00:14:14.312
You need ham in a sandwich. :cue

00:14:15.188 --> 00:14:17.481
We never see eye to eye.

00:14:17.482 --> 00:14:19.067
They're both delicious.

00:14:22.737 --> 00:14:24.029
Detective Joo!

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:25.615
- What... - Yes?

00:14:27.867 --> 00:14:29.367
You're all...

00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:30.994
Can I have a word?

00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:31.996
Yes, sir.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.501
What was that?

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:40.170
- Did you arrest the heir of Chunsik Food? - Yes.

00:14:40.171 --> 00:14:41.463
Is he definitely guilty?

00:14:41.464 --> 00:14:44.382
He's our prime suspect so far.

00:14:44.383 --> 00:14:46.051
He also fled, so we arrested him.

00:14:46.052 --> 00:14:47.762
What if he's innocent? Huh?

00:14:48.471 --> 00:14:50.222
Are you going to make me look bad?

00:14:50.223 --> 00:14:51.515
Do the reporters know?

00:14:51.516 --> 00:14:53.600
What will you do if he's not the culprit?

00:14:53.601 --> 00:14:55.602
Sir.

00:14:55.603 --> 00:14:57.854
Why are you so worried?

00:14:57.855 --> 00:15:01.942
If it's not him, I'll handle it. I'm friends with his dad. We're mutuals.

00:15:03.069 --> 00:15:06.572
In any case, just get it right!

00:15:07.073 --> 00:15:08.074
Get it right!

00:15:10.451 --> 00:15:11.910
Gosh,

00:15:11.911 --> 00:15:15.164
How did someone so timid become a police chief, huh?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.381
SEWON HOSPITAL

00:15:24.382 --> 00:15:26.050
KANG JINKYUNG HEMATOLOGIST-ONCOLOGIST

00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:32.181
Yes, come in.

00:15:36.811 --> 00:15:37.812
Mr. Choi Jeonghun?

00:15:39.188 --> 00:15:40.273
Please have a seat.

00:15:48.406 --> 00:15:50.240
I've gone over your test results,

00:15:50.241 --> 00:15:52.410
And there's a malignant tumor in your stomach.

00:15:56.539 --> 00:15:57.623
Uh, right.

00:15:58.499 --> 00:16:00.501
Don't worry too much. We can treat it.

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:06.007
Uh, the tumor isn't that large,

00:16:07.341 --> 00:16:09.760
But I think surgery will be necessary.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:14.222
- Uh... - Please don't overthink it.

00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:18.895
It's just like a car accident that could happen to anyone.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.900
I'll help you get better.

00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:56.432
DETECTIVE JIN ISOO

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.769
- Hello? -  Mr. Choi.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.437
Did you go to the hospital?

00:17:02.438 --> 00:17:04.606
Yes, I'm there now.

00:17:04.607 --> 00:17:08.568
- Did you get checked out? - Yes. They said everything's fine.

00:17:08.569 --> 00:17:10.946
That's a relief.

00:17:10.947 --> 00:17:14.032
I was scared that you were seriously ill.

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.284
What's there to be scared about?

00:17:16.285 --> 00:17:18.620
You're the only family I have now.

00:17:18.621 --> 00:17:20.622
Don't get sick, okay?

00:17:20.623 --> 00:17:23.208
Eat only the good stuff. No whiskey.

00:17:25.544 --> 00:17:26.629
All right.

00:17:27.546 --> 00:17:30.799
You promised, so it's your turn to see a psychiatrist.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.927
Okay, fine. I'll go after catching the killer.

00:17:33.928 --> 00:17:35.136
Gotta go.

00:17:35.137 --> 00:17:36.138
All right.

00:17:46.566 --> 00:17:48.276
:cue

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.659
SEOUL GANGHA POLICE STATION

00:17:58.411 --> 00:17:59.912
The forensic results are here.

00:18:04.208 --> 00:18:08.004
The one who asked Yeom Jaeseop to meet in Room 709 was Ms. Oh Minyeong.

00:18:08.796 --> 00:18:10.213
They spoke several times.

00:18:10.214 --> 00:18:13.174
Yeom transferred 100 million won to her twice.

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.557
Come to Room 709.

00:18:20.099 --> 00:18:22.434
These texts sound a little strange.

00:18:22.435 --> 00:18:23.977
Where is Yeom Jaeseop right now?

00:18:23.978 --> 00:18:25.229
Kyungjin is tracking him.

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:27.481
Yeom Jaeseop left the country!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.191
Where did he go?

00:18:29.817 --> 00:18:31.986
Hanoi. He just got on board.

00:18:53.841 --> 00:18:55.091
If he disappears, we can't find him.

00:18:55.092 --> 00:18:57.594
Contact Hanoi Airport and get immigration...

00:18:58.679 --> 00:18:59.763
Oh.

00:18:59.764 --> 00:19:01.265
You have a private jet.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.184
How did you know about that?

00:19:04.185 --> 00:19:05.519
I saw it on the news.

00:19:06.395 --> 00:19:08.396
- Can you catch up with him? -  Of course!

00:19:08.397 --> 00:19:09.481
Let's go!

00:19:25.331 --> 00:19:26.666
Come on, run!

00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:30.461
Captain!

00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:32.545
We're off to Hanoi!

00:19:32.546 --> 00:19:34.965
We have to catch the killer! Hey!

00:19:35.716 --> 00:19:37.467
Run!

00:19:37.468 --> 00:19:41.221
Detective Joo! Awesome photo, right?

00:19:41.222 --> 00:19:42.764
Am I the only one embarrassed?

00:19:42.765 --> 00:19:44.225
Just accept it!

00:19:45.267 --> 00:19:46.810
Ta-da!

00:19:46.811 --> 00:19:49.354
The Hansu private jet. This is the premium bar.

00:19:49.355 --> 00:19:51.398
It has all kinds of drinks

00:19:51.399 --> 00:19:53.858
And even a fridge. And a kettle, too.

00:19:53.859 --> 00:19:56.821
Oh, this chair. It's really comfortable. Try sitting down.

00:19:59.907 --> 00:20:01.826
It's nice.

00:20:02.326 --> 00:20:04.035
When do you use this?

00:20:04.036 --> 00:20:05.954
Hmm... Whenever.

00:20:05.955 --> 00:20:09.040
When I go scuba diving or throw parties.

00:20:09.041 --> 00:20:11.543
Ah, I also ride it on December 31st

00:20:11.544 --> 00:20:12.837
And follow the setting sun.

00:20:14.547 --> 00:20:16.798
Classic rich-people behavior.

00:20:16.799 --> 00:20:18.425
It must be nice being rich.

00:20:18.426 --> 00:20:19.885
It definitely doesn't hurt.

00:20:23.806 --> 00:20:25.014
Hey,

00:20:25.015 --> 00:20:26.725
How much does this cost?

00:20:26.726 --> 00:20:27.727
This?

00:20:31.272 --> 00:20:33.190
- What? - Makes you jealous, right?

00:20:34.442 --> 00:20:36.443
I'll lend it to you when you propose.

00:20:36.444 --> 00:20:38.153
- Really? - Yes.

00:20:38.154 --> 00:20:40.155
I love you, bro.

00:20:40.156 --> 00:20:42.240
Mmm. Yeah, me too.

00:20:42.241 --> 00:20:43.867
You promised.

00:20:43.868 --> 00:20:45.994
- Promise. - Okay, for god's sake.

00:20:45.995 --> 00:20:47.747
You all heard, right?

00:20:49.039 --> 00:20:50.040
Hey.

00:20:51.625 --> 00:20:53.586
Would you lend it to me, too?

00:20:55.129 --> 00:20:56.338
You want to get married?

00:20:57.089 --> 00:20:58.257
Are you going to propose?

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.593
No, I mean,

00:21:01.594 --> 00:21:03.178
If the time comes.

00:21:03.179 --> 00:21:04.846
You thought that far ahead?

00:21:04.847 --> 00:21:06.639
Isn't it a little too soon?

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.933
Hey, I'll make a great MC.

00:21:08.934 --> 00:21:11.352
We will now begin the wedding

00:21:11.353 --> 00:21:13.897
Of Groom Park Junyoung and Bride Yoon Jiwon.

00:21:13.898 --> 00:21:15.941
- Please welcome... - Our groom!

00:21:17.026 --> 00:21:18.360
Oh?

00:21:19.487 --> 00:21:20.780
I'm going to the restroom.

00:21:24.325 --> 00:21:25.951
The restroom's up front.

00:21:26.911 --> 00:21:27.912
Stupid.

00:21:46.889 --> 00:21:48.264
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:21:48.265 --> 00:21:50.183
We have arrived at Noi Bai International Airport.

00:21:50.184 --> 00:21:51.602
VIETNAM HANOI AIRPORT

00:22:10.329 --> 00:22:12.205
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:22:12.206 --> 00:22:15.083
This is Jin Isoo Air!

00:22:15.084 --> 00:22:18.086
We are urgently looking for Mr. Yeom Jaeseop! :cue

00:22:19.171 --> 00:22:20.547
I repeat,

00:22:20.548 --> 00:22:24.093
We are urgently looking for Mr. Yeom Jaeseop!

00:22:24.885 --> 00:22:27.345
Would Mr. Yeom Jaeseop please have his passport ready

00:22:27.346 --> 00:22:30.057
And transfer to this aircraft.

00:22:30.808 --> 00:22:33.226
Jin Isoo is here!

00:22:33.227 --> 00:22:35.104
Mr. Yeom Jaeseop!

00:22:38.524 --> 00:22:41.109
SEOUL GANGHA POLICE STATION

00:22:44.405 --> 00:22:47.575
You met Ms. Oh Minyeong at 7:50 p.m. on the day of the murder.

00:22:50.828 --> 00:22:53.622
Just come clean. We've already checked everything.

00:22:56.542 --> 00:22:58.209
Why did you meet her?

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:01.045
Because of my wife. I needed to talk to her.

00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:02.715
What did you talk about?

00:23:03.799 --> 00:23:06.552
She was angry after your wife grabbed her by the hair, right?

00:23:08.387 --> 00:23:09.388
Yes.

00:23:10.598 --> 00:23:12.474
So I tried to make it up to her.

00:23:13.893 --> 00:23:14.894
I'm sorry.

00:23:15.811 --> 00:23:16.895
Whatever.

00:23:16.896 --> 00:23:20.315
When the new hotel opens up, I'll make you a manager there.

00:23:20.316 --> 00:23:22.609
- Really? - Of course.

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:23.777
Oh, you.

00:23:24.528 --> 00:23:26.112
Jaeseop!

00:23:27.323 --> 00:23:29.116
Are you in there?

00:23:32.411 --> 00:23:35.039
I'll go first, so you can come out later.

00:23:40.544 --> 00:23:42.295
I didn't see her after that.

00:23:42.296 --> 00:23:43.839
What time was that?

00:23:49.219 --> 00:23:50.930
I think it was around 8:00 p.m.

00:23:52.765 --> 00:23:55.975
What did you do before going back to your office at 8:20 p.m.?

00:23:55.976 --> 00:23:57.852
I was on the phone, at the stairwell.

00:23:57.853 --> 00:24:00.313
At the stairwell? With whom?

00:24:00.314 --> 00:24:01.565
It was a business call.

00:24:06.737 --> 00:24:08.571
OH MINYEONG BANK STATEMENT

00:24:08.572 --> 00:24:10.324
You gave Ms. Oh 200 million won.

00:24:12.284 --> 00:24:15.203
100 million two months ago, and another 100 million last week.

00:24:15.204 --> 00:24:17.039
It was a form of compensation.

00:24:17.748 --> 00:24:19.207
Because my wife hit her.

00:24:19.208 --> 00:24:21.876
Oh, he must be really well-off.

00:24:21.877 --> 00:24:22.878
Two hundred million won.

00:24:24.630 --> 00:24:26.256
Are you going to keep lying?

00:24:28.133 --> 00:24:30.343
She blackmailed you, didn't she?

00:24:34.723 --> 00:24:36.641
When are you going to send me the money?

00:24:36.642 --> 00:24:39.185
If you keep this up, you're going to regret it.

00:24:39.186 --> 00:24:41.230
"Do not test my patience."

00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:45.566
What's the reason?

00:24:45.567 --> 00:24:47.569
Why did she blackmail you?

00:24:48.821 --> 00:24:50.822
That has nothing to do with this case.

00:24:50.823 --> 00:24:52.241
That's for us to decide.

00:24:53.701 --> 00:24:56.244
You'd had enough of the blackmail, so you killed her.

00:24:56.245 --> 00:24:57.578
That's not true.

00:24:57.579 --> 00:24:59.915
She was definitely alive when I left the room.

00:25:01.041 --> 00:25:02.710
If she were killed in that room,

00:25:04.086 --> 00:25:06.629
It means someone was trying to frame me.

00:25:16.724 --> 00:25:18.224
Open your eyes.

00:25:18.225 --> 00:25:19.935
Open your eyes wide.

00:25:21.645 --> 00:25:23.605
Mmm.  Okay.

00:25:25.024 --> 00:25:26.066
"Leo"?

00:25:27.234 --> 00:25:28.360
Who's Leo?

00:25:29.111 --> 00:25:31.488
Leonardo DiCa... Him?

00:25:38.203 --> 00:25:39.621
ROSEBUD HOTEL STAFF ROSTER

00:25:45.419 --> 00:25:46.462
FRONT DESK JEON YUJIN

00:25:47.963 --> 00:25:49.672
EMPLOYEE RECORD

00:25:49.673 --> 00:25:51.925
It's him. Jeon Yujin.

00:25:53.635 --> 00:25:54.969
NAME JEON YUJIN

00:25:54.970 --> 00:25:56.679
Right, Mr. Jeon Yujin.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:58.639
He was the one in the CEO's office.

00:25:58.640 --> 00:26:00.725
- Check the camera outside the office. -  Okay.

00:26:17.659 --> 00:26:19.827
That's a bit strange.

00:26:23.665 --> 00:26:25.834
What employee barges into the CEO's office?

00:26:26.502 --> 00:26:27.753
We have a new suspect.

00:26:29.338 --> 00:26:30.798
The CEO's mistress.

00:26:31.799 --> 00:26:33.801
No, his male lover.

00:26:37.930 --> 00:26:40.265
:cue

00:26:42.017 --> 00:26:43.018
Mr. Yeom.

00:26:44.103 --> 00:26:47.439
The one you love is Jeon Yujin, isn't it?

00:27:06.291 --> 00:27:08.042
I didn't know I'd turn out this way.

00:27:08.043 --> 00:27:10.671
I'm married, and I even have a kid.

00:27:12.631 --> 00:27:14.591
I fell for him like crazy.

00:27:15.467 --> 00:27:18.302
TWO MONTHS EARLIER

00:27:18.303 --> 00:27:20.013
- Sir. - Yes, Mr. Yu.

00:27:22.724 --> 00:27:24.685
- These are our new employees. - Ah.

00:27:27.020 --> 00:27:28.230
Nice to meet you.

00:27:40.701 --> 00:27:41.827
Welcome to our hotel.

00:27:48.876 --> 00:27:51.210
-  Cheers. -  Cheers.

00:27:55.924 --> 00:27:58.259
- Let me pour you one. - Thank you.

00:27:58.260 --> 00:27:59.594
I look forward to working with you.

00:27:59.595 --> 00:28:01.388
Enjoy your food.

00:28:04.099 --> 00:28:05.934
Sir, let me pour you a glass, too.

00:28:11.940 --> 00:28:13.024
Thank you.

00:28:13.025 --> 00:28:14.108
Thank you for dinner.

00:28:14.109 --> 00:28:15.526
Have a safe trip home.

00:28:15.527 --> 00:28:17.654
Take care.

00:28:18.405 --> 00:28:19.531
Sir...

00:28:20.282 --> 00:28:21.491
Watch your step.

00:28:24.036 --> 00:28:25.454
Thank you.

00:28:57.319 --> 00:28:58.402
Stop the car.

00:29:04.701 --> 00:29:06.744
Get in. I'll take you home.

00:29:21.343 --> 00:29:22.344
Dry yourself.

00:30:06.596 --> 00:30:08.515
Don't start anything if you're not sure.

00:30:09.349 --> 00:30:11.226
I don't want to get hurt anymore.

00:30:13.812 --> 00:30:15.022
Yujin.

00:30:19.443 --> 00:30:20.944
Even if you're an alien,

00:30:21.570 --> 00:30:22.571
Or a man...

00:30:24.489 --> 00:30:26.158
I really don't know anymore.

00:30:29.369 --> 00:30:30.954
Let's see this through to the end.

00:30:44.801 --> 00:30:46.970
We met secretly in Room 709.

00:30:54.352 --> 00:30:56.520
Mmm. It's good.

00:30:56.521 --> 00:30:57.773
Yes, it's delicious.

00:30:58.356 --> 00:30:59.815
Do you like wine?

00:30:59.816 --> 00:31:01.317
Oh, I do. :cue

00:31:01.318 --> 00:31:02.569
It felt like a dream.

00:31:03.320 --> 00:31:04.321
But...

00:31:05.530 --> 00:31:06.907
It didn't last long.

00:31:45.821 --> 00:31:47.781
Then the blackmail started.

00:32:00.418 --> 00:32:02.629
Mr. Yeom.

00:32:04.923 --> 00:32:06.800
Why are you so cheap?

00:32:07.759 --> 00:32:09.385
You really think this is enough?

00:32:12.764 --> 00:32:14.432
So I sent her 100 million won.

00:32:15.016 --> 00:32:18.895
Then my wife caused a scene, so I sent her another 100 million.

00:32:19.855 --> 00:32:23.108
But that day, she said she wanted to see me.

00:32:30.240 --> 00:32:32.993
Minyeong, what do you want me to do?

00:32:34.161 --> 00:32:35.871
My feet are killing me.

00:32:39.541 --> 00:32:41.168
I think I might quit.

00:32:42.377 --> 00:32:44.045
I don't want to come into work,

00:32:44.921 --> 00:32:47.048
And I'm sick of all the annoying guests.

00:32:50.969 --> 00:32:52.636
Mr. Yeom.

00:32:52.637 --> 00:32:54.139
I'd like a leaving bonus.

00:32:57.100 --> 00:32:58.810
I don't have any money.

00:32:59.978 --> 00:33:02.522
If you don't have money, what does that make me?

00:33:05.275 --> 00:33:06.567
Honey! Get out here!

00:33:06.568 --> 00:33:07.860
Are you in there?

00:33:07.861 --> 00:33:09.528
Where are you?

00:33:09.529 --> 00:33:10.572
Look who's busted.

00:33:11.156 --> 00:33:12.406
Come out here!

00:33:12.407 --> 00:33:13.450
Shall I open the door?

00:33:15.118 --> 00:33:16.328
Wait.

00:33:17.829 --> 00:33:19.915
Okay, fine.

00:33:20.624 --> 00:33:21.833
I want one billion won.

00:33:23.001 --> 00:33:24.336
I need time.

00:33:26.838 --> 00:33:28.131
Will a month do?

00:33:29.466 --> 00:33:32.801
Mr. Yeom, I'm going to take leave starting tomorrow.

00:33:47.984 --> 00:33:49.110
Yujin.

00:33:51.196 --> 00:33:52.280
Let's end this.

00:33:55.408 --> 00:33:57.993
What's wrong? Did Oh Minyeong blackmail you again?

00:33:57.994 --> 00:34:00.955
There's nothing more to say. Let's end it.

00:34:00.956 --> 00:34:02.748
I told you not to start if you're unsure.

00:34:02.749 --> 00:34:04.667
You said you'd see it through.

00:34:04.668 --> 00:34:07.378
This is the end! Don't you get it?

00:34:07.379 --> 00:34:09.296
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:34:09.297 --> 00:34:11.423
How can I work here when I have to see you?

00:34:11.424 --> 00:34:13.802
Then you leave! You can just quit!

00:34:15.595 --> 00:34:16.721
Jaeseop.

00:34:25.563 --> 00:34:27.148
Then why did you flee?

00:34:28.316 --> 00:34:30.485
When I heard Oh Minyeong had died,

00:34:31.403 --> 00:34:32.987
I had a bad feeling.

00:34:35.156 --> 00:34:37.367
Had Yujin killed her?

00:34:37.951 --> 00:34:39.452
No, it couldn't be.

00:34:40.787 --> 00:34:43.038
But when I heard she died in Room 709,

00:34:43.039 --> 00:34:45.417
I thought Yujin had killed her in that room

00:34:46.001 --> 00:34:48.128
To get revenge on me.

00:34:50.547 --> 00:34:52.173
I didn't know what to do,

00:34:53.967 --> 00:34:55.802
So I just ran away.

00:34:56.428 --> 00:34:58.597
Is this something you can just run away from?

00:35:01.808 --> 00:35:02.809
By the way,

00:35:04.269 --> 00:35:05.687
Why is it "Leo"?

00:35:07.939 --> 00:35:09.899
It's Yujin's zodiac sign.

00:35:10.734 --> 00:35:12.151
Ah.

00:35:12.152 --> 00:35:13.194
His zodiac sign.

00:35:14.154 --> 00:35:17.156
Right, you're quite the romantic.

00:35:17.157 --> 00:35:18.533
Ah.

00:35:19.117 --> 00:35:20.619
His zodiac sign. :cue

00:35:24.914 --> 00:35:25.998
How did it go?

00:35:25.999 --> 00:35:28.209
It was a tragic love story.

00:35:28.752 --> 00:35:30.754
It touched my heart. Ah.

00:35:31.338 --> 00:35:33.422
Let's look into Jeon Yujin.

00:35:33.423 --> 00:35:35.716
Kyungjin, trace his movements on that day.

00:35:35.717 --> 00:35:37.802
- And find out where he is now. - Got it.

00:35:47.354 --> 00:35:49.564
Take out all your belongings.

00:35:53.234 --> 00:35:54.319
Mr. Yeom.

00:35:54.903 --> 00:35:55.987
Did you...

00:35:57.280 --> 00:35:59.323
Kill Minyeong?

00:36:02.827 --> 00:36:05.913
It was you, asshole. You killed her, didn't you?

00:36:05.914 --> 00:36:07.164
Come here.

00:36:09.584 --> 00:36:10.918
Come here right now!

00:36:10.919 --> 00:36:14.630
Do you have any idea how much I loved her?

00:36:14.631 --> 00:36:16.716
Kang Chunsik! Get back.

00:36:17.967 --> 00:36:20.387
What are you going to do about Minyeong?

00:36:21.137 --> 00:36:24.098
What are you going to do about me?

00:36:35.110 --> 00:36:38.655
Jeon Yujin answered the call at 8:05 p.m.

00:36:40.448 --> 00:36:41.532
Hello?

00:36:41.533 --> 00:36:42.991
Yujin.

00:36:42.992 --> 00:36:44.868
Let's end this.

00:36:48.289 --> 00:36:51.126
He left the CEO's office and went to the bar.

00:37:02.137 --> 00:37:04.138
He must've seen Chunsik there.

00:37:04.139 --> 00:37:06.682
He would've thought of using Room 701.

00:37:06.683 --> 00:37:10.437
Because it was well-known that Kang Chunsik liked Ms. Oh.

00:37:11.020 --> 00:37:12.813
I found the last footage of Ms. Oh.

00:37:12.814 --> 00:37:14.149
I think she was on the roof.

00:37:15.734 --> 00:37:18.194
She got on the staff elevator at 8:40 p.m.

00:37:26.161 --> 00:37:29.247
She must have hidden out on the roof to avoid Mr. Yeom's wife.

00:37:38.757 --> 00:37:40.133
Fifteen minutes.

00:37:41.009 --> 00:37:42.761
Where was Jeon Yujin during this time?

00:37:47.682 --> 00:37:49.142
Back to the changing room.

00:38:07.994 --> 00:38:10.788
He must've gone to get his radio and the master key.

00:38:10.789 --> 00:38:12.791
This was when he decided to kill her.

00:38:17.003 --> 00:38:19.380
He snuck into Room 701.

00:38:21.049 --> 00:38:22.258
Ms. Oh.

00:38:22.926 --> 00:38:24.469
A call came in from Room 701.

00:38:25.094 --> 00:38:26.888
He told her Chunsik had called for her.

00:38:32.435 --> 00:38:36.313
All we have is the motive.

00:38:36.314 --> 00:38:38.191
No murder weapon,

00:38:38.900 --> 00:38:41.027
And the radio call wouldn't have been logged.

00:38:43.154 --> 00:38:45.030
Where's Jeon Yujin after that?

00:38:45.031 --> 00:38:46.741
:cue

00:38:47.742 --> 00:38:48.826
The elevator.

00:38:55.834 --> 00:38:58.169
There's only an eight-minute gap.

00:38:59.963 --> 00:39:03.006
In that time, he killed the victim,

00:39:03.007 --> 00:39:05.133
Moved the body, and cleaned up?

00:39:05.134 --> 00:39:06.511
That's impossible, isn't it?

00:39:07.178 --> 00:39:09.931
- It's impossible, without an accomplice. - No, wait.

00:39:11.224 --> 00:39:12.934
Why move the body?

00:39:13.977 --> 00:39:15.395
He saw Chunsik at the bar

00:39:18.314 --> 00:39:21.567
And called her to Room 701 to dump it on Chunsik.

00:39:22.986 --> 00:39:23.987
That's true.

00:39:24.696 --> 00:39:26.405
There's no reason to move the body.

00:39:26.406 --> 00:39:27.948
What if after killing her,

00:39:27.949 --> 00:39:30.827
He wanted to get revenge on Yeom Jaeseop and moved the body?

00:39:31.578 --> 00:39:34.621
No, that can't be done in eight minutes.

00:39:36.082 --> 00:39:38.501
This wasn't a premeditated murder.

00:39:39.210 --> 00:39:41.211
How can there be an accomplice?

00:39:41.212 --> 00:39:43.756
What on earth could have happened?

00:39:44.757 --> 00:39:47.844
Who moved the body and even cleaned up?

00:39:53.725 --> 00:39:57.312
Someone who knows that the security camera was broken.

00:39:57.979 --> 00:40:00.314
Someone who can move without drawing attention

00:40:00.315 --> 00:40:03.735
And move the body without raising any suspicion.

00:40:04.527 --> 00:40:06.613
Someone who has access to all the rooms.

00:40:07.363 --> 00:40:09.616
Someone who can clean perfectly.

00:40:13.453 --> 00:40:15.580
- Housekeeping. -  No way.

00:40:17.373 --> 00:40:19.042
What about housekeeping?

00:40:19.667 --> 00:40:23.211
Yeom could've given the order after finding out Jeon had killed her.

00:40:27.425 --> 00:40:28.551
I killed her.

00:40:30.553 --> 00:40:31.554
I...

00:40:32.805 --> 00:40:34.265
I ended up killing her.

00:40:35.934 --> 00:40:37.101
I'll take care of it.

00:40:38.728 --> 00:40:40.103
Get out of there right now.

00:40:40.104 --> 00:40:41.981
In the room he personally used?

00:40:42.941 --> 00:40:45.693
He probably hid the body first to deal with later.

00:40:48.029 --> 00:40:51.073
We'll go to the hotel, so identify the housekeeping staff.

00:40:51.074 --> 00:40:53.283
And find out where Jeon dumped his jacket.

00:40:53.284 --> 00:40:54.701
-  Understood. - Okay.

00:40:59.999 --> 00:41:02.042
How could it be one of those ladies?

00:41:02.043 --> 00:41:03.835
- It's so good. - It's really delicious.

00:41:03.836 --> 00:41:05.671
Now I see why it's 100,000 won.

00:41:05.672 --> 00:41:07.548
Is there anyone you can rule out?

00:41:09.884 --> 00:41:10.885
There is.

00:41:11.594 --> 00:41:15.347
Gosh, you keep calling us ladies and flattering us like that.

00:41:15.348 --> 00:41:19.101
If that was an act, she deserves an Oscar.

00:41:29.904 --> 00:41:31.363
There you are.

00:41:31.364 --> 00:41:33.324
What? What is it?

00:41:34.158 --> 00:41:35.492
Did you find the killer?

00:41:35.493 --> 00:41:36.910
Uh, well...

00:41:36.911 --> 00:41:39.080
- We have something to ask you. - What is it?

00:41:39.998 --> 00:41:41.915
Were any of the housekeeping staff

00:41:41.916 --> 00:41:45.043
Acting suspiciously on the day of the murder or the next day?

00:41:45.044 --> 00:41:47.255
What? Us, the housekeeping staff?

00:41:48.131 --> 00:41:49.549
What are you talking about?

00:41:50.258 --> 00:41:53.844
Someone moved Ms. Oh Minyeong's body.

00:41:53.845 --> 00:41:55.972
Someone from the housekeeping staff?

00:41:56.681 --> 00:41:57.890
Who?

00:41:58.558 --> 00:42:00.143
It's a possibility.

00:42:01.477 --> 00:42:02.645
Did anyone seem odd?

00:42:03.312 --> 00:42:04.647
Oh...

00:42:07.859 --> 00:42:08.942
What is it?

00:42:08.943 --> 00:42:10.403
:cue

00:42:11.529 --> 00:42:13.822
She was cleaning the cart.

00:42:13.823 --> 00:42:15.408
She said she spilled coffee on it.

00:42:20.288 --> 00:42:21.496
My gosh.

00:42:21.497 --> 00:42:23.540
What are you doing?

00:42:23.541 --> 00:42:25.000
I spilled some coffee.

00:42:25.001 --> 00:42:26.626
- Really? - Yes.

00:42:26.627 --> 00:42:27.711
You startled me.

00:42:27.712 --> 00:42:30.464
You should clock out. I'll tidy up in here.

00:42:30.465 --> 00:42:32.133
- Okay. - Bye.

00:42:37.555 --> 00:42:39.181
We found her. It's Na Yeonhong.

00:42:40.641 --> 00:42:41.851
EMPLOYEE RECORD NA YEONHONG

00:42:43.436 --> 00:42:44.603
JEON YUJIN

00:42:44.604 --> 00:42:45.813
She's Jeon Yujin's mom.

00:42:51.194 --> 00:42:52.361
She's Jeon Yujin's mom.

00:42:53.821 --> 00:42:56.199
She knew her son killed someone and covered it up.

00:45:13.586 --> 00:45:15.295
MINYEONG

00:45:16.881 --> 00:45:19.424
We'll find evidence if we check the cart.

00:45:19.425 --> 00:45:21.384
Let's arrest Ms. Na Yeonhong first.

00:45:21.385 --> 00:45:22.762
Wait.

00:45:24.013 --> 00:45:25.264
Let me talk to her first.

00:45:26.098 --> 00:45:27.516
:cue

00:45:47.370 --> 00:45:48.871
Something on your mind?

00:45:50.790 --> 00:45:52.499
No, nothing.

00:45:52.500 --> 00:45:54.042
Would you like some tea?

00:45:54.043 --> 00:45:55.418
Thank you.

00:45:55.419 --> 00:45:56.879
Here.

00:46:11.352 --> 00:46:12.895
One moment, please.

00:46:26.492 --> 00:46:28.243
You must be tired.

00:46:28.244 --> 00:46:31.664
I'm fine. Everyone has to make a living.

00:46:33.666 --> 00:46:34.750
My mom

00:46:35.918 --> 00:46:38.003
Died when I was young.

00:46:38.004 --> 00:46:40.506
Gosh, I'm sorry to hear that.

00:46:41.590 --> 00:46:43.466
I was lonely, so I acted out

00:46:43.467 --> 00:46:45.803
And did a lot of stupid things.

00:46:48.264 --> 00:46:50.016
No matter how badly I messed up,

00:46:51.100 --> 00:46:52.642
She'd be on my side, right?

00:46:52.643 --> 00:46:54.312
Of course.

00:46:55.021 --> 00:46:57.732
To a mother, her child will always be her baby.

00:46:59.066 --> 00:47:01.402
There's nothing she wouldn't do for her child.

00:47:02.528 --> 00:47:03.529
You're right.

00:47:05.072 --> 00:47:06.949
My mom would've been the same.

00:47:09.994 --> 00:47:11.162
But if I...

00:47:13.831 --> 00:47:16.459
Committed an unforgivable crime,

00:47:18.836 --> 00:47:22.006
And if my mom was punished for trying to protect me,

00:47:24.216 --> 00:47:25.217
I would probably...

00:47:27.345 --> 00:47:29.889
Never be able to forgive myself.

00:47:34.643 --> 00:47:36.604
Please tell me

00:47:38.230 --> 00:47:39.522
What happened.

00:47:47.656 --> 00:47:49.116
I killed her.

00:47:51.577 --> 00:47:54.413
This isn't the right thing for Yujin.

00:47:56.040 --> 00:47:57.625
Please reconsider.

00:48:00.419 --> 00:48:01.504
I'm sorry.

00:48:06.509 --> 00:48:08.177
Please tell the truth.

00:48:08.886 --> 00:48:10.763
Everything will come to light in the end.

00:48:17.645 --> 00:48:19.438
I killed Ms. Oh Minyeong.

00:48:25.152 --> 00:48:26.153
Get up.

00:48:36.580 --> 00:48:37.623
Ms. Na Yeonhong,

00:48:38.249 --> 00:48:40.625
You're under arrest for Ms. Oh Minyeong's murder.

00:48:40.626 --> 00:48:43.044
You have the right to an attorney

00:48:43.045 --> 00:48:45.505
And the right to remain silent.

00:48:45.506 --> 00:48:47.675
You won't be penalized for remaining silent.

00:49:10.072 --> 00:49:11.156
Stop right there!

00:49:25.421 --> 00:49:26.589
Wait! :cue

00:49:29.049 --> 00:49:30.092
No, Yujin!

00:49:31.302 --> 00:49:33.845
- I killed her. -  Yujin!

00:49:33.846 --> 00:49:34.972
No.

00:49:36.765 --> 00:49:39.018
Yujin...

00:49:39.685 --> 00:49:41.478
My mom did nothing wrong.

00:49:41.479 --> 00:49:43.230
No, Yujin, no.

00:49:44.106 --> 00:49:45.149
Yujin, my baby.

00:49:45.900 --> 00:49:47.693
Yujin, no.

00:49:49.320 --> 00:49:50.738
Yujin!

00:49:52.490 --> 00:49:53.741
No, not you.

00:49:55.326 --> 00:49:56.868
- No, Yujin. - I'm sorry.

00:49:56.869 --> 00:49:58.871
My baby.

00:50:01.790 --> 00:50:05.376
I was the one who killed her.

00:50:05.377 --> 00:50:07.128
Me!

00:50:07.129 --> 00:50:08.297
Oh, my goodness.

00:50:10.966 --> 00:50:13.219
Please, no, my baby.

00:50:14.053 --> 00:50:15.970
My baby.

00:50:27.816 --> 00:50:28.817
You're right.

00:50:31.070 --> 00:50:33.447
I called her over to Room 701 and killed her.

00:51:06.564 --> 00:51:07.772
What are you doing?

00:51:07.773 --> 00:51:09.107
Just stop.

00:51:10.734 --> 00:51:11.735
Stop what?

00:51:12.444 --> 00:51:13.821
You got your money.

00:51:14.488 --> 00:51:15.948
So stop blackmailing us.

00:51:19.034 --> 00:51:21.787
I basically struck gold here.

00:51:22.538 --> 00:51:24.123
Would you stop if you were me?

00:51:36.135 --> 00:51:37.136
You...

00:51:37.928 --> 00:51:39.221
Are you out of your mind?

00:51:39.847 --> 00:51:42.099
Yes, I'm out of my mind.

00:52:03.954 --> 00:52:07.041
Then I heard the body was found in Room 709,

00:52:10.085 --> 00:52:12.296
So I thought Mr. Yeom had covered up for me.

00:52:15.090 --> 00:52:17.384
I had no idea it was my mom.

00:52:18.636 --> 00:52:20.304
I guess you didn't tell the hotel

00:52:21.013 --> 00:52:22.723
You were working with your mother.

00:52:23.432 --> 00:52:24.433
No.

00:52:26.769 --> 00:52:29.020
She's been working there for a while,

00:52:29.021 --> 00:52:30.564
And I...

00:52:32.107 --> 00:52:34.026
I started working this year.

00:52:35.152 --> 00:52:37.528
My mom said we should act like strangers,

00:52:37.529 --> 00:52:39.657
Because nothing good would come from it.

00:52:42.826 --> 00:52:45.663
After she got divorced, I was all she had.

00:52:47.665 --> 00:52:48.707
Because of me...

00:52:49.833 --> 00:52:50.834
My mom...

00:52:54.338 --> 00:52:58.092
All you're worried about is your mom after you murdered someone?

00:53:02.346 --> 00:53:03.639
You're a murderer.

00:53:06.600 --> 00:53:08.435
You ended someone's life.

00:53:14.108 --> 00:53:16.235
Was it worth all that?

00:53:23.534 --> 00:53:24.660
:cue

00:53:33.043 --> 00:53:36.504
Mr. Yeom Jaeseop, Mr. Kang Chunsik, you're cleared of all suspicion.

00:53:36.505 --> 00:53:37.506
You are free to go.

00:53:41.844 --> 00:53:43.928
- Jaeseop! - Dad!

00:53:43.929 --> 00:53:46.098
What happened, huh?

00:53:47.391 --> 00:53:48.392
Did you kill her?

00:53:49.226 --> 00:53:50.309
No.

00:53:50.310 --> 00:53:52.270
Then what?

00:53:52.271 --> 00:53:54.105
You're cheating, aren't you?

00:53:54.106 --> 00:53:56.274
It's all over. Just stop.

00:53:57.443 --> 00:53:59.527
You're a coward until the end.

00:53:59.528 --> 00:54:00.904
Why did you even start it?

00:54:05.367 --> 00:54:06.493
It's Leo.

00:54:14.835 --> 00:54:16.128
Seran.

00:54:18.005 --> 00:54:20.466
Yujin is the one I love.

00:54:22.509 --> 00:54:24.218
Yujin?

00:54:24.219 --> 00:54:25.720
Wait,

00:54:25.721 --> 00:54:27.848
Who the hell is Yujin?

00:54:33.103 --> 00:54:34.104
Oh, my god.

00:54:45.532 --> 00:54:47.910
Then why did Minyeong die?

00:54:49.786 --> 00:54:52.039
She was a blackmailer.

00:54:53.373 --> 00:54:55.459
She blackmailed them and was murdered.

00:54:56.418 --> 00:54:58.378
My sweet, angelic Minyeong

00:55:00.130 --> 00:55:01.339
Was a blackmailer?

00:55:01.340 --> 00:55:03.257
Don't pass out, seriously.

00:55:03.258 --> 00:55:04.383
Huh?

00:55:06.094 --> 00:55:07.429
Kang Chunsik!

00:55:08.096 --> 00:55:10.265
Now even a man is...

00:55:11.016 --> 00:55:12.391
A man...

00:55:12.392 --> 00:55:14.686
Come on, seriously?

00:55:15.312 --> 00:55:17.688
Is passing out contagious now? What the heck?

00:55:17.689 --> 00:55:19.900
For god's sake!

00:55:20.651 --> 00:55:22.945
Hello, 119? Yes, this is Gangha Police Station.

00:55:38.001 --> 00:55:40.546
Let's go drink some soju, team.

00:55:41.171 --> 00:55:42.172
Yes, sir.

00:55:43.632 --> 00:55:46.384
- We should go for a beer, too. - Sounds great.

00:55:46.385 --> 00:55:48.262
I have plans, so I'll get going.

00:55:48.929 --> 00:55:51.389
Stay for one drink. We caught the killer.

00:55:51.390 --> 00:55:53.182
I'm already late. I'm off.

00:55:53.183 --> 00:55:54.725
- Okay, bye. - See you tomorrow.

00:55:54.726 --> 00:55:55.810
Have a good evening!

00:55:55.811 --> 00:55:58.479
What kind of team leader skips drinks with the team?

00:55:58.480 --> 00:56:00.314
Come on, bro. Let's go.

00:56:00.315 --> 00:56:01.774
My feelings are hurt.

00:56:01.775 --> 00:56:03.359
- Seriously, I'm hurt. -  Let's go.

00:56:03.360 --> 00:56:05.070
She got a boyfriend? What's with her?

00:56:06.738 --> 00:56:08.156
-  Cheers! -  Cheers!

00:56:20.460 --> 00:56:21.670
Mmm!

00:56:22.087 --> 00:56:24.672
Hey, this flavor is insane.

00:56:24.673 --> 00:56:26.215
I've been craving this lately.

00:56:26.216 --> 00:56:29.427
They're famous for their gopdoritang, but this is good too, right?

00:56:29.428 --> 00:56:30.803
It's so sweet and savory.

00:56:30.804 --> 00:56:32.513
I can't stop eating it.

00:56:32.514 --> 00:56:34.224
I'll have to come back next time.

00:56:35.309 --> 00:56:37.603
With who? Your girlfriend?

00:56:38.895 --> 00:56:39.979
No.

00:56:39.980 --> 00:56:41.355
By myself.

00:56:41.356 --> 00:56:43.065
I saw they have meals for one here.

00:56:43.066 --> 00:56:44.735
I'm coming back for lunch by myself.

00:56:45.360 --> 00:56:46.444
Mmm...

00:56:46.445 --> 00:56:48.154
:cue

00:56:49.364 --> 00:56:51.617
This case was driven by an all-consuming love.

00:56:52.326 --> 00:56:53.993
Love is all-consuming by nature.

00:56:53.994 --> 00:56:55.162
Is it?

00:56:55.912 --> 00:56:56.997
Is it, Junyoung?

00:56:58.373 --> 00:57:01.292
I've never had an office romance before.

00:57:01.293 --> 00:57:03.337
It's fun to secretly date a coworker, right?

00:57:04.546 --> 00:57:06.965
How does it feel? Tell me, I'm curious.

00:57:08.342 --> 00:57:09.467
That's enough.

00:57:09.468 --> 00:57:10.926
I don't know who it is.

00:57:10.927 --> 00:57:13.346
I just had a feeling you were dating a coworker.

00:57:13.347 --> 00:57:15.849
Yeah, who could it be? I'm dying to know.

00:57:17.059 --> 00:57:18.184
Ah!

00:57:18.185 --> 00:57:20.978
No wonder he always volunteered to go to the morgue.

00:57:20.979 --> 00:57:22.897
I noticed a long time ago.

00:57:22.898 --> 00:57:25.191
I've been dating since I was in seventh grade.

00:57:25.192 --> 00:57:26.318
I'm a dating expert.

00:57:27.235 --> 00:57:28.653
Will you two just shut up?

00:57:28.654 --> 00:57:30.780
I don't think so. I'm going to say more.

00:57:30.781 --> 00:57:32.865
You should be keeping things professional.

00:57:32.866 --> 00:57:34.450
The autopsy room? How dare you!

00:57:34.451 --> 00:57:36.078
The autopsy room, what?

00:57:37.037 --> 00:57:39.414
- It's where your love blossomed. - The autopsy room!

00:57:41.333 --> 00:57:43.251
You guys are awful.

00:57:44.002 --> 00:57:45.087
Jiwon.

00:57:45.754 --> 00:57:48.130
Yes, we're dating.

00:57:48.131 --> 00:57:50.258
Is that really something to tease him about?

00:57:51.510 --> 00:57:52.844
- What's with you two? - No.

00:57:53.637 --> 00:57:55.596
We should celebrate. Right, Kyungjin?

00:57:55.597 --> 00:57:56.681
Yes, of course.

00:57:56.682 --> 00:57:57.766
Right.

00:57:59.309 --> 00:58:01.268
Here, let me pour you one.

00:58:03.021 --> 00:58:05.439
I thought you were the Grim Reaper.

00:58:05.440 --> 00:58:06.650
Leave my Junyoung alone.

00:58:07.776 --> 00:58:09.777
You know what my job is, right?

00:58:09.778 --> 00:58:12.364
- Congratulations. - Congratulations from me, too!

00:58:14.074 --> 00:58:15.158
- Cheers. - Cheers.

00:58:19.246 --> 00:58:20.247
That hits the spot.

00:58:21.123 --> 00:58:23.666
How did you two end up together?

00:58:23.667 --> 00:58:24.751
Well, we just

00:58:25.544 --> 00:58:27.838
Met by chance and ended up eating together.

00:58:28.588 --> 00:58:30.465
That wasn't by chance.

00:58:31.341 --> 00:58:32.425
What?

00:58:33.760 --> 00:58:35.386
I timed it and waited for you.

00:58:35.387 --> 00:58:36.555
Waited!

00:58:38.223 --> 00:58:39.306
Uh...

00:58:39.307 --> 00:58:40.934
Really? I had no idea.

00:58:41.685 --> 00:58:43.602
Dummy.

00:58:43.603 --> 00:58:46.355
Even a guy that clueless has a girlfriend.

00:58:46.356 --> 00:58:47.857
I know.

00:58:47.858 --> 00:58:49.317
I don't get it at all. Cheers.

00:58:51.528 --> 00:58:53.487
Remember, I asked you where you lived.

00:59:02.873 --> 00:59:04.582
Uh, you look well.

00:59:04.583 --> 00:59:06.083
That's freelancing for you.

00:59:06.084 --> 00:59:08.711
It's great not being a cop.

00:59:08.712 --> 00:59:11.797
All those reports. Just thinking about it ruins my drink.

00:59:15.177 --> 00:59:16.302
What about you?

00:59:16.303 --> 00:59:18.013
What's it like being back at Gangha?

00:59:18.680 --> 00:59:20.055
I like it.

00:59:20.056 --> 00:59:23.392
There's a real thrill in catching murderers one by one.

00:59:23.393 --> 00:59:26.146
I kind of miss that.

00:59:27.939 --> 00:59:29.149
What's Jin Isoo like?

00:59:30.442 --> 00:59:31.818
Jin Isoo is

00:59:32.944 --> 00:59:35.906
Resourceful and quick on his feet.

00:59:36.490 --> 00:59:38.407
It's fun working with him.

00:59:38.408 --> 00:59:39.492
Ah...

00:59:39.493 --> 00:59:41.118
I thought you'd be missing me.

00:59:41.119 --> 00:59:43.746
Uh, you're the one who decided to leave.

00:59:43.747 --> 00:59:45.665
Here.

00:59:51.087 --> 00:59:52.297
Cheers.

01:00:00.096 --> 01:00:01.556
He's coming back in two days.

01:00:04.184 --> 01:00:05.519
I've got everything ready.

01:00:10.315 --> 01:00:11.358
:cue

01:00:12.234 --> 01:00:14.110
Sometimes, I suddenly can't breathe.

01:00:15.320 --> 01:00:17.321
For no reason at all,

01:00:17.322 --> 01:00:21.826
I feel like the walls are closing in when I'm inside places like elevators.

01:00:21.827 --> 01:00:25.956
I want to hear your story first.

01:00:27.374 --> 01:00:28.499
What kind of story?

01:00:28.500 --> 01:00:30.836
Let's start with your parents.

01:00:31.920 --> 01:00:35.549
Your brother, the one you trusted the most, killed your parents.

01:00:38.051 --> 01:00:42.305
I'd like to hear how you feel about that.

01:00:44.349 --> 01:00:46.476
Did you know that I caught a psychiatrist?

01:00:47.769 --> 01:00:50.939
She hypnotized me and even killed people.

01:00:51.898 --> 01:00:54.526
That's why I'm not a big fan of psychiatrists.

01:00:55.277 --> 01:00:57.444
I'd rather you just give me the medication,

01:00:57.445 --> 01:00:58.613
Instead of wasting time.

01:01:01.616 --> 01:01:04.410
You experienced some traumatic events in the past

01:01:04.411 --> 01:01:06.787
And also became the target of bombings recently.

01:01:06.788 --> 01:01:10.000
This is likely why you are experiencing these symptoms.

01:01:10.750 --> 01:01:13.002
Talking honestly about your feelings

01:01:13.003 --> 01:01:16.130
And finding closure can really help your recovery.

01:01:16.131 --> 01:01:17.799
You think talking about it

01:01:19.050 --> 01:01:20.759
Is enough to give me closure?

01:01:20.760 --> 01:01:22.470
Let's give it a try.

01:01:24.848 --> 01:01:26.641
I'll have to find another hospital.

01:01:27.434 --> 01:01:28.894
I'll give you the medication.

01:01:30.687 --> 01:01:34.316
Whenever you feel like talking, we can talk then.

01:02:27.786 --> 01:02:29.204
ECSTASY A BREATHLESS FALL

01:02:36.628 --> 01:02:38.546
CLIMAX LIGHT SCATTERED ACROSS THE UNIVERSE

01:02:42.467 --> 01:02:44.469
DISSOLUTION THE SILENCE OF WHISPERING REEDS

01:02:53.895 --> 01:02:57.815
YU SEONGWON, THE SCULPTOR WHO CAPTIVATED THE EUROPEAN ART WORLD,

01:02:57.816 --> 01:03:01.527
RETURNS AFTER 4 YEARS TO HOLD A SOLO EXHIBITION IN KOREA

01:03:01.528 --> 01:03:05.656
RETURN YU SEONGWON'S SOLO EXHIBITION

01:03:15.500 --> 01:03:17.127
:cue

01:03:41.651 --> 01:03:43.611
DISSOLUTION THE SILENCE OF WHISPERING REEDS

01:04:20.857 --> 01:04:21.982
FLEX X COP 2 EPISODE 6

01:04:21.983 --> 01:04:24.026
AS THE MYSTERY DEEPENS, YU SEONGWON EMERGES

01:04:45.048 --> 01:04:48.550
Special Cast. Choi Dukmoon, Lee Suk

01:04:48.551 --> 01:04:51.303
♪ Every move was never mine ♪

01:04:51.304 --> 01:04:54.431
♪ I don't take the checkmate ♪

01:04:59.604 --> 01:05:02.440
Park Jaeha's magic show! These tickets are impossible to get.

01:05:02.941 --> 01:05:04.483
He died in a fire mid-show.

01:05:04.484 --> 01:05:06.527
The escape routine went as planned.

01:05:06.528 --> 01:05:08.362
Something did feel off, though.

01:05:08.363 --> 01:05:09.655
- A premonition? - Yes.

01:05:09.656 --> 01:05:11.281
This was murder, not an accident.

01:05:11.282 --> 01:05:13.450
Someone poured kerosene inside the coffin.

01:05:13.451 --> 01:05:14.743
Who made the coffin?

01:05:14.744 --> 01:05:15.828
Mr. Park Jaeha?

01:05:15.829 --> 01:05:17.579
- I'm Park Jaehyung. -  Twins?

01:05:17.580 --> 01:05:19.581
Who could do something so horrific?

01:05:21.084 --> 01:05:22.167
Please don't touch.

01:05:22.168 --> 01:05:23.252
It was three days earlier.

01:05:23.253 --> 01:05:25.337
How are a gangster and a magician linked?

01:05:25.338 --> 01:05:26.588
Bring that bastard in.

01:05:26.589 --> 01:05:28.799
Let go. Did you kill him?

01:05:28.800 --> 01:05:31.635
If I did, you wouldn't even find a body.

01:05:31.636 --> 01:05:33.387
He knew he was going to die?

01:05:33.388 --> 01:05:35.515
Betting against me takes that much.

01:05:49.988 --> 01:05:50.989
Joo Hyera.

01:06:01.666 --> 01:06:03.209
Got a lot on your mind?

01:06:09.549 --> 01:06:11.008
Still chasing Yu Seongwon?

01:06:11.009 --> 01:06:14.386
YU SEONGWON RETURNS AFTER 4 YEARS TO HOLD A SOLO EXHIBITION IN KOREA

01:06:14.387 --> 01:06:16.555
That's why you came back, isn't it?

01:06:18.850 --> 01:06:20.392
I get how you feel.

01:06:20.393 --> 01:06:22.853
It's a case you can never forget.

01:06:22.854 --> 01:06:26.107
But we already verified Yu Seongwon's alibi.

01:06:31.404 --> 01:06:33.072
You're obsessed.

01:06:33.573 --> 01:06:34.698
Huh?

01:06:34.699 --> 01:06:36.366
That's what ruins a detective.

01:06:36.367 --> 01:06:38.119
It's not an obsession.

01:06:39.245 --> 01:06:40.371
Yu Seongwon...

01:06:42.040 --> 01:06:43.750
Will kill again.

01:06:45.001 --> 01:06:46.419
And I'm going to stop him.

01:06:53.927 --> 01:06:55.929
Translated by Hyesoo Lee

